| Check | Condition |
|---|---|
| Map present | `percentByGauId` is neither `null` nor empty |
| Percent > 0 | Every value is non-null and `> 0` |
| Total ≤ 100 | `SUM(values) ≤ 100` (a total < 100 is allowed) |
| GAU active | Every GAU Id resolves to a record whose `npsp__Status__c = 'Active'` |

Any failure throws `GauAllocationService.AllocationException` before a single `delete` or `insert` is issued.

