| Single DML | One `insert contacts;` statement. |
| Skip only the welcome-task action | `new TAF_Bypass('TA_Contact_CreateWelcomeTask')` targets that one action name; the before-insert `TA_Contact_FormatPhone` is unaffected and still strips formatting. |
